# Terraform working directory
**/.terraform/

# Terraform state
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
**/terraform.tfstate
**/terraform.tfstate.*

# Terraform variable files containing secrets
terraform.tfvars
*.auto.tfvars
**/terraform.tfvars
**/*.auto.tfvars

# Crash logs
crash.log
crash.*.log

# Override files
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json

# Environment / secret files
.env
.env.*
!.env.example*.pem
